# The Fidget revision vendored in this directory.
#
# The Rust sources under the fidget* crate directories are an in-tree copy of
# the fork below at "commit". The fork is upstream Fidget plus our commits (see
# its FORK.md), so "git log <upstream-base>..<commit>" in the fork lists every
# change we carry.
#
# To update: check out the commit you want in the fork, change "commit" here,
# and from the repository root run
#
#   go run ./tool/vendor-fidget -fork <checkout of the fork>
#
# It replaces the sources and reports how the fork's Cargo.toml files differ
# from the vendored ones; the manifests are reconciled by hand.
